export anchor BackgroundSize:
    description:
        Sets the size of the background image.

    identifier: backgroundSize

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `background-size` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `cover`
        - `contain`
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`
        - `<width> <height>`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            backgroundSize: cover
        \\\
        ```
